  << /ActualText (Collaborated with a team to develop IddirNet\054 a platform for Ethiopian communities\054 enabling transparent payment tracking and resource monitoring through data\055driven insights\056\n\nConducted both desk research and primary data collection to analyze the problem and identify possible solutions\056\nDesigned brand assets including logos\054 brand guidelines\054 and user interface designs\054 using Figma\054 Adobe Illustrator\054 and Photoshop to enhance brand aesthetics\056\nIntegrated external APIs i\056e\056 Daraja API and internal APIs to enable robust functionality and data exchange\056\nDeveloped an informational website and an admin dashboard using Next\056js to highlight real\055time analytics and clear data visualizations\056\nDeveloped a mobile app using Kotlin to provide members with accessible data\240 and user\055friendly interface for members to easily track contributions and resources\056\n\nWorked on a team case study to develop data\055driven solutions addressing the decline in sales among \030Mama Mbogas\031 \050women selling groceries at kiosks\051\056\n\nUtilized PostgreSQL to create relational schemas that represent complex relationships among attributes\056\nDeveloped APIs with Django REST framework to manage user data efficiency\056\nCreated system architecture diagram to illustrate both data flow and the interactions between individual components of the system\056\nConducted unit and integration testing to maintain software quality\056\nDeveloped and implemented a Mama Mboga Advisor AI that provides guidance for maintaining vegetable freshness\056\n\nDeveloped an innovative conversational Movie Recommendation system by leveraging \n\nIMDB dataset and preprocessed dataset using Pandas and NumPy\054 ensuring data quality by filtering sparse entries and enhancing text with SpaCy lemmatization\056\n\nBuilt Benenew\054 an online gift registry platform that enables users to create\054 customize\054 and share gifts for occasions or events\056\n\nBuilt RESTful APIs using Node\056js\054 Express\056js\054 and JWT authentication for user management\056\nIntegrated Chapa Payment API to enable secure online monetary contributions\056\n\nCustomized and maintained the Birhan Addis Charity Organization website using WordPress and Elementor\054 ensuring a responsive and user\055friendly design\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1714 0 R
     /Pg 1707 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
